  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nIt's not possible to do Instance Moderation Actions (e.g. Warn User, Kick User, Force Mic Off) via the Main Menu, it's only possible through the Quick Menu at the moment. This can be confusing to some who are used to use the Main Menu for this.\nIt also results int the Vote Kick option being available in the Main Menu, even though it's gone in the Quick Menu since you can directly kick them.\n# Suggestion:\nAdd Instance Moderation Actions to the Main Menu User Profiles. This would make it consistent with the Quick Menu and would allow people to chose if they rather want to do something via the Quick or Main Menu.\n# Attachments:\nThe first picture shows the Quick Menu and the second picture the Main Menu:",
